OL,3,GNEWSAMerry midwives' final curtain
OL,4,Aafter 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of nurses that has raised
OL,7,Faround #150,000 over 40 years of
OL,8,Fstaging charity shows is preparing to
OL,9,Ftake its final bow.
OL,11,FThe Merry Midwives was set up by Julie
OL,12,FBrady and a colleague in 1986. They got
OL,13,Fthe performing bug after they were
OL,14,Fasked to put together a skit for the
OL,15,Fformer Nuneaton Maternity Hospital
OL,16,Fshow.
OL,18,FThe pair pulled together a group to
OL,19,Fraise funds for hospital equipment, and
OL,20,Floved it so much they decided to
OL,21,Fcontinue, picking up firm friends along
OL,22,Fthe way.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
