OL,3,GNEWSAMerry midwives' final curtain
OL,4,Aafter 40 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrady, now 69, who lives in Nuneaton
OL,7,Fand directs the performances, said The
OL,8,FMerry Midwives - The Final Curtain at
OL,9,FAbbey Theatre in October would feel
OL,10,F"bittersweet", adding: "We want to go
OL,11,Fout on a high."
